                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "This game brings back the old Swords and Sandals feel, but with a whole new mechanic that basically kills your character even if you're doing really good. Some examples I've seen in the half hour I've played are: Eating a poisoned fish; falling off a ledge, etc. I'm assuming that some adventure choices would also instantly kill you, which I find unfair. I don't wanna sit there and do everything right just for some RNG to tell me I'm dead. It just makes the game feel wrong somehow.",
